:: Street killer - group [Place bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">STREETS</h1>
<br />
<center>
    <<image 'places/underground/street_killer_group.jpg'>>
</center>
<br /><br />
The alley opened into a small courtyard behind a collapsed building. You heard them before you saw them — laughter, the clink of bottles.
<br /><br />
Four of them. Only two looked like they could actually fight, but that was enough. One of them clocked you the moment you stepped in and the laughter stopped.
<br /><br />
You could see dried blood on the nearest one's knuckles.
<br /><br />
They spread out without a word — the casual confidence of men who'd done this before.
<br /><br />
<<generateEnemies 2>>
<<link 'Fight'>>
    <<fight $enemies 'Street killer - group won' 'Street killer - group lost'>>
<</link>>
<<link 'Back off'>>
    <<unset $game.streetsKilledNpc>>
    <<goto 'Underground city'>>
<</link>>
